    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Trace the Loop\r\n\r\nThe program below uses a for loop to move the Painter. Before you run it, trace it by hand using the table in your Unit Guide.\r\n\r\n1. Fill in one row for each pass through the loop.\r\n2. Write the value of j and the square the Painter is on after that pass.\r\n3. Predict where the Painter ends.\r\n4. Run the program and compare with your table. Fix any rows that don't match.",
